{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"getKeyMode","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RFIDResult","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.rfid.RFIDManager\/documentation\/RFIDManager\/RFIDResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@RFIDManager@objc(cs)RFIDResult"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the fetch is successful, the data field of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.rfid.RFIDManager\/documentation\/RFIDManager\/RFIDResult","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is Int."},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"text","text":"如果获取成功，"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.rfid.RFIDManager\/documentation\/RFIDManager\/RFIDResult","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"的data字段为"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"English","text":"English","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The KeyMode parameter controls the trigger mode of the device’s scan key."},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"text","text":"When KeyMode = 0, the key value 1 will be returned in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyUpBlock"},{"type":"text","text":" callback of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RFIDBleManager.shared.setKeyEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" when the scan key is lifted;"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"text","text":"When KeyMode = 1, the key value 3 will be returned in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyDownBlock"},{"type":"text","text":" callback of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RFIDBleManager.shared.setKeyEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" when the scan key is pressed, and the key value 4 wi